  "sourceTitle": "Spicy Nuts",
  "sourceText": "Spicy Nuts\nBy: Andie Mitchell\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 7:51pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup whole almonds\n1 cup pecan halves\n1 cup walnut halves\n2 tablespoons walnut oil\n2 teaspoons curry powder\n2 teaspoons cumin\n1 teaspoon cayenne pepper\n1 teaspoon white pepper\nsalt, to taste\nPreheat the oven to 350 degrees.\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a large bowl combine the nuts and oil to coat evenly. Combine the spices and toss to distribute evenly. Spread the nuts on a cookie sheet and bake for 10 minutes. 2 Salt to your taste.",
  "parsedSource": {
